      "content": "This state initializer mutates a module-level cache during rendering, contrary to the render-side-effect requirement. React can replay or abandon a render, but clearing this map cannot be rolled back. Move draft invalidation to a committed navigation lifecycle or an effect, coordinating it with draft consumption so a normal Review still cannot restore a stale draft.",
      "existing_code": "  useState(() =\u003e {\n    if (params.get('replay') !== 'open') discardDraftsSetAside();\n  });",
